WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.829
Detection rules transform telemetry into actionable signals that support defenders.

2
00:00:04.829 --> 00:00:16.343
Effective rules begin with meaningful behaviors, use appropriate data sources, balance signal and noise, document assumptions clearly, validate performance, and evolve over time.

3
00:00:16.343 --> 00:00:19.526
The goal is not to generate alerts for their own sake.

4
00:00:19.526 --> 00:00:29.424
The goal is helping analysts identify and investigate activity that matters while keeping detections maintainable, understandable, and operationally useful.
